log * Global replace: replace every occurrence of `LEGACY_SKU` with `ARCHIVE_SKU` in every file under `src/legacy/` and write all three files to disk. Editors with a project-wide replace do it in one operation; the rest open each file, replace within it and save - both are the same user action and both are in scope
